  "limitations": [
    "These ablations use real model routing; they do not establish all-shape or all-device optimality.",
    "TTFT includes framework scheduling and prefill batching variation; the first control B1 outlier is retained.",
    "Short diagnostic traces are separate from timed 32-output-token throughput samples and cannot establish causation alone.",
    "Earlier outgoing ACK polling did not shorten dispatch; increased contention is a hypothesis, not a measured PCIe transaction attribution.",
    "The independent receiver variant changes the common block from 320 to 288 threads (one control warp plus 256 RX workers) and increases the grid from two to three CTAs per channel. Its result cannot be attributed exclusively to one scheduling effect.",
    "No new end-to-end prefill gain is established. All candidate header changes target bounded decode; TTFT differences are reported without claiming a causal prefill improvement."
